        "Physics and Chemistry reward routines. The data booklet should be familiar, units should appear in every line, and the scientific investigation needs a question that a home or school set-up can really answer. Students in this region have good raw material: cooling of water in clay pots, hardness of well water, or the effect of pH on seed germination, all workable if the method is tight.",
